    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Louis Vallerand",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110762574925831775380/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLPN12f2dfhgXMML-GJmjvgGmGkiw3sUkT-KOUJT3b-CiY5C9k=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "You can drop off books and food. I don't know if this is there store policy or the employee who did not want to do there job, but I brought a few hundrer dollars worth of stuff to donate including books and food. And the employee was telling me that in the future they would not accept the food if I didn't triage the past date ones. Maybe I am wrong, but I think that if I'm already going through the trouble of bringing you the free stuff for you to sell. The least you could do is do triage a few cans that are past date. Otherwise next time I will just throw the stuff out and not go through the trouble.\n\nOtherwise good store and easy dropoff.",
        "time": 1759671911,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Megan Baharov",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103333784395657539634/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWZErP4mpdV21QIqfTNcU-_lGzcNhA0GQl1GxLjd49_UIY8sSEJ1A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Really disappointed with the customer service this time. I’ve been here before and usually have a good experience, but today was something else. I saw a teddy bear I liked (I collect them) sitting out with some items the staff were going through. I politely asked if I could buy it and even offered to pay on the spot, but was rudely told no, with attitude because they “had to check if it was broken.” I even asked if they knew when it could be sold and they just repeated their go to speach. They easily could’ve checked it  right then and there since it wasn’t busting, but instead, they were too busy standing around gossiping. It felt like they just didn’t want to be bothered.\n\nOn top of that, my sister asked to see some jewelry and was completely ignored. The employee actually sighed, walked outside, and didn’t come back. My sister had to ask three times just to be acknowledged. I’ve never had service like this here before, which makes it even more disappointing. We came in excited to shop, and left feeling unwelcome. Do better.",
        "time": 1754334924,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Carol Silas",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111261925254799872499/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWHMOLFs1tZtO2Z2dyCpCaN3qHPo8ilapiGI9BHLuycVQb-0QI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Great experience. It was my first time at this Renaissance Librairie location and it’s by far my favourite. Excellent selection—I got several books for myself, my kids and my mother. Fantastic service—the woman who assisted me and the lady before me was helpful, patient and super sweet. And even though it’s 15km away, I will definitely be going back. Highly recommend.",
        "time": 1748133353,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Thomass Burger",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101441432602092987499/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVeHBWWOSmYQjXqR6V-XxI6WAGTDQHlDTK2LmbOtE21GWA4WUM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Always love to come here. The staff is always super friendly and the prices are very affordable. There are definitely hidden pearls here. Any bookworms, french or english, would love it. There is a wide selection of both official languages for anyone interested.",
        "time": 1736030723,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "rhonda gold",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109728826045705899649/reviews",
